# The build context is the repository root, and .gitignore does not apply here. This file is
# therefore the only thing standing between a key on this laptop and a layer in a public
# registry, so it denies everything first and then names what may enter.
*

# The product. Both the directory and its contents: a `!` on the children alone leaves the
# directory itself excluded by `*`, and `docker build` warns on every COPY because of it.
!src/katalis
!src/katalis/**

# The two data layers the gates read. `recorded/` is what the 6 Sep 2026 capture paid for;
# `synth/` is needed because DEMO_CASES — and so four of the five gate suites — includes a
# synthetic case, and `./run.sh test` has to pass inside the image, not beside it.
!research
!research/harness
!research/harness/recorded
!research/harness/recorded/**
!research/harness/synth
!research/harness/synth/**

# Denied again, after the allowances above, because a `!` line can otherwise re-admit them
# from inside an allowed directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.git/
**/.DS_Store
**/state/
**/*.jsonl
